Robotics Competition Rules
1. Robot Design and Assembly
- Each team must independently design and assemble its own robot.
2. Hardware and Component Regulations
- Commercial modules such as STM32 Blackpill and TB6612FNG are permitted.
- Teams are also allowed to design and manufacture their own electronic circuits.
- If sample PCBs or open-source software are used, their origins must be disclosed and relevant documentation must be submitted to the Organizing Committee.
3. Communication and External Connectivity
- Wireless communication is prohibited.
- Connecting to external devices to control the robot is prohibited.
